      <title>CedarLogic 4.0.1 beta</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 20:17:25 -0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4.0.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>4.0.1 beta</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>CedarLogic 4.0.1 beta</h3>
<ul>
<li>Updates now install from inside the app (Help &gt; Check for Updates).</li>
<li>New setting: Settings &gt; General &gt; Testing group (Normal or Beta tester).</li>
<li>Both Mac apps are here: <b>CedarLogic-4.0.1-mac.dmg</b> (the classic CedarLogic) and <b>CedarLogic-Native-4.0.1-mac.zip</b> (the new native Mac app). First launch: right-click &gt; Open.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
